<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Citicorp gets $150 mln loan.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Citicorp gets $150 mln loan.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Citicorp Equity Investments SA said Thursday it has signed a loan agreement for $150 million with local Banco de Galicia y Buenos Aires SA.</p>
<p>The $150 million loan was forwarded to Citicorp Equity Investments on Wednesday. It will be paid off in three equal installments in March 1999, March 2000 and March 2001, Citicorp said in a statement.</p>
<p>No further details of the transaction were given.</p>
<p>((-- Axel Bugge, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668))</p>
</text>
